  "description": "“Dark World,” the game I, a thirty-year-old salaryman, had devoted my entire youth to. \n\n“What the fuck is this…” \n\nWhen I opened my eyes, Dark World had become my reality. The pouring rain, dripping hot blood, and a cold blade. At the moment of my impending death, I came into this familiar world. \n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
